(" our", " Our") is by far the strongest, about 6; "our" in other languages
(unsere, notre, nostro, nuestro, наш, 我们的 ...) is about 3 to 5; subject "we"
and object "us" are about 1.3 to 1.6; "my" is about 0.9; "ours" about 2.
