"""Approximate a document-start correction, especially on chat/tool markup.

Leading-space content words start negative; bare declarations, headings,
ASCII digits and function words start positive. Negative opening phrases
fade until punctuation, whitespace or a function word. Explicit message,
thinking and tool delimiters have position-decaying pulses. Other later
text gets zero. Document boundaries, not new messages, reset the state.
