"""A short-range lexical coordination detector.

Predict a large positive activation on linking adverbs and question words
immediately after 'and', smaller ones on function words, and weaker versions
after 'but' or 'or'. It also reacts when 'and' begins a longer word. A linking
word one token farther away receives a small response. All state resets at
document boundaries; most other tokens are predicted near zero.
